  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Light; <strong>CL</strong> 5th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> head; <strong>Price</strong> 1,500 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> -</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nA dimlight veil cuts the glare of light and the sun, shielding the eyes. The wearer is immune the dazzled condition, and suffer no ill-effects from light sensitivity. In addition, the wearer gains a +2 bonus on saving throws against Light effects.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nForge Charm, Light sphere; <strong>Cost</strong> 750 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/charms#toc15\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
